{"id":"n17289-1-21","stage":1,"title":"금요일 · 星期五","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n17289-1-21-1","ko":"민준아, 즐거운 금요일 밤인데 왜 공부를 하니?","zh":"敏俊啊，今天是愉快的周五晚上，你怎么还在学习呢？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"민준아,","meaning":"敏俊","explanation":"민준：敏俊；아：呼格助词，用来称呼关系亲近的人或晚辈。","readings":[{"term":"민준아","audio":"/audio/8016ce64193f3153a82a.mp3"}],"sources":[],"surfaceReading":{"term":"민준아","audio":"/audio/8016ce64193f3153a82a.mp3"}},{"text":"즐거운","meaning":"愉快，欢乐，欢快","explanation":"즐겁다：愉快，欢乐，欢快；은：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"즐겁다","audio":"/audio/71ab7f4d89daedabda61.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62101","senseId":"1","lemma":"즐겁다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"즐거운","audio":"/audio/b976aba1e2d93272736d.mp3"}},{"text":"금요일","meaning":"星期五，周五，礼拜五","explanation":"금요일：星期五，周五，礼拜五","readings":[{"term":"금요일","audio":"/audio/a594e9b583050ec46ff9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17289","senseId":"1","lemma":"금요일","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"금요일","audio":"/audio/a594e9b583050ec46ff9.mp3"}},{"text":"밤인데","meaning":"夜，夜间","explanation":"밤：夜，夜间；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；ㄴ데：先交代背景，再引出后文的转折、补充、请求或问题。","readings":[{"term":"밤","audio":"/audio/da9e530428ce1c2deaf3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74178","senseId":"1","lemma":"밤","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"밤인데","audio":"/audio/83964b7db067f623443e.mp3"}},{"text":"왜","meaning":"为什么","explanation":"왜：为什么","readings":[{"term":"왜","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67848","senseId":"1","lemma":"왜","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"왜","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3"}},{"text":"공부를","meaning":"学习，读书","explanation":"공부：学习，读书；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"공부","audio":"/audio/c9b4aed6d54a88472fe8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"36672","senseId":"1","lemma":"공부","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"공부를","audio":"/audio/6cf72634fef36a3407ff.mp3"}},{"text":"하니?","meaning":"做，干","explanation":"하다：做，干；니：非敬语疑问句末，用于亲近的人、晚辈或自问。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"1","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"하니","audio":"/audio/917bc632330b55c71985.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"71ab7f4d89daedab","term":"즐겁다","zh":"愉快，欢乐，欢快","audio":"/audio/71ab7f4d89daedabda61.mp3","entryId":"62101","definition":"内心满意、满足且快乐。","pronunciation":["즐겁따"]},{"id":"a594e9b583050ec4","term":"금요일","zh":"星期五，周五，礼拜五","audio":"/audio/a594e9b583050ec46ff9.mp3","entryId":"17289","definition":"以星期一为基准，指一个星期中的第五天。","pronunciation":["그묘일"]},{"id":"da9e530428ce1c2d","term":"밤","zh":"夜，夜间","audio":"/audio/da9e530428ce1c2deaf3.mp3","entryId":"74178","definition":"日落到第二天日出前的黑暗时段。","pronunciation":["밤"]},{"id":"08b35eb63efd4aaa","term":"왜","zh":"为什么","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3","entryId":"67848","definition":"因什么原因；或指怎么。","pronunciation":["왜ː"]},{"id":"c9b4aed6d54a8847","term":"공부","zh":"学习，读书","audio":"/audio/c9b4aed6d54a88472fe8.mp3","entryId":"36672","definition":"通过学习学问或技术而获得知识。","pronunciation":["공부"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"做，干","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"进行某种行动、动作或活动。","pronunciation":["하다"]}],"audio":"/audio/bc5957d659a297917865.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n17289-1-21-2","ko":"내일 시험이 있거든. 토요일 오전에 시험을 보다니 너무해.","zh":"因为明天有考试。居然要在周六上午考试，太不公平了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"내일","meaning":"明天，明日","explanation":"내일：明天，明日","readings":[{"term":"내일","audio":"/audio/1e07b94ba5182a41e7de.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30193","senseId":"1","lemma":"내일","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"내일","audio":"/audio/1e07b94ba5182a41e7de.mp3"}},{"text":"시험이","meaning":"考试","explanation":"시험：考试；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"시험","audio":"/audio/ff65dc582ce71198934b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20233","senseId":"1","lemma":"시험","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"시험이","audio":"/audio/3539bd8e76462c84a4b0.mp3"}},{"text":"있거든.","meaning":"有","explanation":"있다：有；거든：补充理由或背景，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68797","senseId":"3","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"있거든","audio":"/audio/bf9165e0bdebff2c037f.mp3"}},{"text":"토요일","meaning":"星期六，周六，礼拜六","explanation":"토요일：星期六，周六，礼拜六","readings":[{"term":"토요일","audio":"/audio/9f4eef79554b65d023ca.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30214","senseId":"1","lemma":"토요일","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"토요일","audio":"/audio/9f4eef79554b65d023ca.mp3"}},{"text":"오전에","meaning":"上午","explanation":"오전：上午；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"오전","audio":"/audio/1087feb238ccd11091f9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20246","senseId":"1","lemma":"오전","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"오전에","audio":"/audio/204a543d0270edf31098.mp3"}},{"text":"시험을","meaning":"考试","explanation":"시험：考试；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"시험","audio":"/audio/ff65dc582ce71198934b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20233","senseId":"1","lemma":"시험","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"시험을","audio":"/audio/9883915d2c932328fd00.mp3"}},{"text":"보다니","meaning":"考，参加","explanation":"보다：考，参加；다니：对得知的内容表示惊讶、感叹，并连接后文。","readings":[{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61190","senseId":"12","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"보다니","audio":"/audio/626673e1436835d4e0bb.mp3"}},{"text":"너무해.","meaning":"太过分","explanation":"너무하다：太过分；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"너무하다","audio":"/audio/ca5df3fe8202b5437c1e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"42328","senseId":"1","lemma":"너무하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"너무해","audio":"/audio/d8897a130349832515a6.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"1e07b94ba5182a41","term":"내일","zh":"明天，明日","audio":"/audio/1e07b94ba5182a41e7de.mp3","entryId":"30193","definition":"今天的下一天。","pronunciation":["내일"]},{"id":"ff65dc582ce71198","term":"시험","zh":"考试","audio":"/audio/ff65dc582ce71198934b.mp3","entryId":"20233","definition":"按照问题、提问、实际行动等一定程序考核考生的知识或能力的事宜。","pronunciation":["시험"]},{"id":"96fe52db2531c9e7","term":"있다","zh":"有","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3","entryId":"68797","definition":"将要完成或进行某件事情。","pronunciation":["읻따"]},{"id":"9f4eef79554b65d0","term":"토요일","zh":"星期六，周六，礼拜六","audio":"/audio/9f4eef79554b65d023ca.mp3","entryId":"30214","definition":"以星期一为基准，指一个星期中的第六天。","pronunciation":["토요일"]},{"id":"1087feb238ccd110","term":"오전","zh":"上午","audio":"/audio/1087feb238ccd11091f9.mp3","entryId":"20246","definition":"从早晨到中午十二点期间。","pronunciation":["오ː전"]},{"id":"6a45cf834264a5ec","term":"보다","zh":"考，参加","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3","entryId":"61190","definition":"为了鉴定知识水平或能力而进行考试。","pronunciation":["보다"]},{"id":"ca5df3fe8202b543","term":"너무하다","zh":"太过分","audio":"/audio/ca5df3fe8202b5437c1e.mp3","entryId":"42328","definition":"令人产生反感的言行超过一定的限度。","pronunciation":["너무하다"]}],"audio":"/audio/9c99ad846b69e84b9903.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.64,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=17289","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"초급","day":51,"sequenceScore":2.2376,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["因为明天有考试。居然要在周六上午考试，太不公平了。","我这个年纪，有没有适合的爱好呢？","敏俊啊，今天是愉快的周五晚上，你怎么还在学习呢？"],"answer":2},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["因为明天有考试。居然要在周六上午考试，太不公平了。","敏俊啊，今天是愉快的周五晚上，你怎么还在学习呢？","我这个年纪，有没有适合的爱好呢？"],"answer":0}]}
